**Decides BM_TERRAIN (0x19) and nothing else.** `ret 8`, no direct callers - slot 20 of CCombatant, and although it is on the shared base **only the land slot 19 calls it** (0x16A960), so BM_TERRAIN is land-only in practice.

    terrain = this->combat(+0x3C)->terrain(+0x24)
    adj     = unit->+0xC8->terrain_adjusters(+0x54)[terrain->id(+0x8)]      ; 0x18 bytes each
    if is_attacker(+0x38): v = terrain->attack(+0x50)  + adj->attack(+0x8)
    else:                  v = terrain->defence(+0x4C) + adj->defence(+0xC)
    if v != 0: this->+0x21 = 1; CUnit::AddCombatModifier(unit, BM_TERRAIN, v, v)

The index/stride are `lea eax,[eax+eax*2]` then `lea eax,[edi+eax*8]` = 24 bytes, which confirms CSubUnitDefinition.terrain_adjusters is indexed by terrain id. **No define enters at all.** Because unit->+0xC8 is the division's own summed CSubUnitDefinition, the adjuster term is the sum over the division's brigades. Signature corrected 2026-10-02 by the signature audit (reversing/findings/FINDINGS-sigaudit.md).
